   "text": "يوم",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Concatenated unit word; Arabic number agreement differs from English (e.g. 10/20 take singular يومًا), so script-level pluralisation may read slightly unnatural for some counts."
   ]
